Package: svmfsmeta
Type: Package
Language: en-US
Title: Multiobjective SVM Feature Selection via Metaheuristics
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Solves the bi-objective soft-margin support vector machine (SVM) with feature selection (FS) problem. Implements a metaheuristic based on the Non-dominated Sorting Genetic Algorithm II (NSGA-II) for Pareto frontier approximation, together with tools for model assessment and visualization. Methods implemented in the package are described in Alcaraz (2024) <doi:10.1016/j.cor.2024.106821> and Valero-Carreras et al. (2023) <doi:10.1016/j.cor.2022.106131>.
